   geolocator references that API (ITMS-90683). */
"NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription" = "Sheikh Ahmed uses your location to calculate accurate prayer times and the Qibla direction for where you are.";
"NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription" = "Sheikh Ahmed uses your location to calculate accurate prayer times and the Qibla direction for where you are.";
"NSLocationAlwaysUsageDescription" = "Sheikh Ahmed uses your location to calculate accurate prayer times and the Qibla direction for where you are.";

/* Microphone permission prompt. */
"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" = "Sheikh Ahmed uses the microphone in memorization practice to record your recitation so you can listen back to it. Recordings stay on your device.";
